const categories={"politica":1,"economia":2,"cidades":3,"esporte":4,"justica":5,"mundo":6,"tecnologia":7,"piaui":8,"sao-paulo":9,"rio-de-janeiro":10,"ceara":11,"cultura":12,"geral":13,"saude":14};
const {candidates,coverage,queue,stage_for_publication=false,publish_enabled=false}= $json;
if (![candidates,coverage,queue].every(Array.isArray)||!candidates.length||candidates.length>10||coverage.length>30||queue.length>30) throw Error('Lote inválido.');
if(candidates.some(x=>!x||!Object.hasOwn(categories,x.editoria)||typeof x.id!=='string'||!x.id||typeof x.title!=='string'||typeof x.text!=='string'||!/^https?:\/\//.test(x.url))||new Set(candidates.map(x=>x.id)).size!==candidates.length)throw Error('Candidatas inválidas.');
return {json:{candidates:candidates.map(({id,title,text,url,editoria})=>({id,title:title.slice(0,500),text:text.slice(0,16000),url,editoria})),coverage,queue,stage_for_publication:stage_for_publication===true,publish_enabled:stage_for_publication===true&&publish_enabled===true}};

const lot=$('Validar lote').item.json;
if($json.status!=='completed'||!Array.isArray($json.output))throw Error('Direção sem parecer completo.');
const parts=$json.output.flatMap(x=>x.content??[]).filter(x=>x.type==='output_text').map(x=>x.text);
const verdict=parts.length===1&&typeof parts[0]==='object'?parts[0]:JSON.parse(parts.join(''));
const inputs=new Map(lot.candidates.map(x=>[x.id,x]));
const seen=new Set();
const dispatched=[];
const withheld=[];
const canonical=value=>typeof value==='string'?value.trim().replace(/^https?:\/\//i,'').split(/[?#]/,1)[0].replace(/\/$/,'').replace(/^[^/]+/,host=>host.toLowerCase()):'';
if(!Array.isArray(verdict?.decisions)||verdict.decisions.length!==inputs.size)throw Error('O parecer precisa cobrir o lote inteiro.');
for(const decision of verdict.decisions){
 const {id,action,priority,target_id,reason,angle,question,contribution}=decision;
 if(!inputs.has(id)||seen.has(id)||!['abrir','atualizar','aguardar','descartar'].includes(action)||!['urgente','alta','normal'].includes(priority)||!reason?.trim())throw Error('Decisão inválida.');
 seen.add(id);
 if(action==='atualizar'&&!lot.coverage.some(x=>x.id===target_id))throw Error('Atualização sem matéria correspondente.');
 if(action!=='atualizar'&&target_id!==0)throw Error('Alvo incompatível.');
 if(!['abrir','atualizar'].includes(action))continue;
 if(!angle?.trim()||!question?.trim()||!contribution?.trim())throw Error('Pauta sem briefing.');
 const candidate=inputs.get(id);
 const same=lot.coverage.some(x=>[x.url,x.original_link].some(url=>canonical(url)&&canonical(url)===canonical(candidate.url)));
 if(same){withheld.push({id,reason:'origem_ja_coberta'});continue;}
 if(action==='atualizar'&&(!decision.new_fact?.trim()||!decision.new_evidence?.trim()||!candidate.text.includes(decision.new_evidence.trim())||lot.coverage.some(x=>x.id===target_id&&[x.title,x.excerpt,x.content].some(text=>typeof text==='string'&&text.includes(decision.new_evidence.trim()))))){
  withheld.push({id,reason:'fato_novo_sem_evidencia_distinta'});continue;
 }
 const occupied=lot.queue.some(x=>x.status==='em_redacao'&&(x.url===candidate.url||(target_id>0&&x.target_id===target_id)));
 if(occupied||dispatched.some(x=>x.source.url===candidate.url||(target_id>0&&x.target_id===target_id)))continue;
 dispatched.push({...decision,editoria:candidate.editoria,responsavel:'redator_'+candidate.editoria.replaceAll('-', '_'),stage_for_publication:lot.stage_for_publication===true,publish_enabled:lot.publish_enabled===true,prazo_minutos:{urgente:15,alta:45,normal:120}[priority],source:{url:candidate.url,title:candidate.title,text:candidate.text}});
}
const rank={urgente:0,alta:1,normal:2};
const queue=lot.queue.filter(x=>x.status==='aguardando').map(x=>({...x,origin:'fila_existente'})).concat(dispatched.map(x=>({...x,origin:'direcao'}))).sort((a,b)=>(rank[a.priority]??2)-(rank[b.priority]??2));
return {json:{mode:'piloto',decisions:verdict.decisions,withheld,dispatch:queue}};
